  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n **First term × 2 + Second term + 10 = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(37, 42, 126)\n\n__**37 × 2**__ + 42 + 10 = 126\n\n__**74 **____**+ 42 + 10**__ = 126\n\n126 = 126\n\n(21, 26, 78) \n\n__21 × 2__ + 26 + 10 = 78\n__42 ____+ 26 + 10__ = 78\n\n78 = 78\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (24, 30, 90) \n\n__24 × 2__ + 30 + 10 = 90\n__48 ____+ 30 + 10__ = 90\n88 ≠ 90\n\nOption 2) (30, 36, 118) \n__30 × 2__ + 36 + 10 = 118\n__60 ____+ 36 + 10__ = 118\n106 ≠ 118\n\nOption 3) (33, 38, 114)\n__33 × 2__ + 38 + 10 = 114\n__66 ____+ 38 + 10__ = 114\n114 = 114\n\nOption 4) (28, 35, 110) \n__28 × 2__ + 35 + 10 = 110\n__56 ____+ 35 + 10__ = 110\n101 ≠ 110\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"option (3)\".**",
